      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Lonnie has made great progress with building a Regiment separate from both other sides of the war since her and the boys deserted. They had soldiers, money, equipment, a growing reputation,  and things were looking good for them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Until all of their Crimson Waste contacts stop responding, and sheâ€™s forced to pause everything to go investigate. In the middle of doing this though, someone decides to pay her a visit.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
